@startuml
allowmixing
!pragma layout smetana
set namespaceSeparator none
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #45627B
skinparam classBackgroundColor #EEF5FB
skinparam classBorderColor #45627B
skinparam packageBackgroundColor #FAFCFE
hide empty members
title Result storage and surrounding MIT simulation improvements

left to right direction
class FlightControllerSimulatorListener
class FlightComputerData
class FlightComputerControllerPlots
class FlightComputerLogReader
class FlightDataBranch
class EnsembleRunner
class EnsembleRunListener
class GaussianThrustNoise
class EnsembleAccumulator
class EnsembleResult
class EnsembleRunArchive
class EnsembleBandRenderer
class EnsembleDistributionDialog
class TrajectoryData
class Trajectory3DDialog
class Trajectory3DPanel
class MotorBatchRunner
class MotorBatchSnapshot
class MotorBatchReport
class MotorBatchCSV
FlightControllerSimulatorListener --> FlightComputerData : measured/truth samples
FlightControllerSimulatorListener --> FlightComputerControllerPlots : diagnostics
FlightComputerData --> FlightDataBranch
FlightComputerControllerPlots --> FlightDataBranch
FlightComputerLogReader --> FlightDataBranch : external log import
EnsembleRunner *-- EnsembleRunListener
EnsembleRunListener --> GaussianThrustNoise : T(t) + e(t)
EnsembleRunner --> EnsembleAccumulator
EnsembleAccumulator --> EnsembleResult : mean + sample standard deviation
EnsembleRunner --> EnsembleRunArchive : individual flights
EnsembleBandRenderer --> EnsembleResult : 2D mean ±1σ
EnsembleDistributionDialog --> EnsembleResult : individual scalar metrics
TrajectoryData --> FlightDataBranch : position + quaternion + events
TrajectoryData --> EnsembleResult : mean trajectory
Trajectory3DDialog *-- Trajectory3DPanel
Trajectory3DPanel --> TrajectoryData
MotorBatchRunner --> MotorBatchSnapshot : isolated worker baselines
MotorBatchRunner --> MotorBatchReport
MotorBatchCSV --> MotorBatchReport
note bottom of FlightDataBranch
Digital FC state/command channels use held-value plotting.
3D orientation follows recorded quaternions, not velocity direction.
Actual recovery events control the canopy animation.
end note

@enduml
